              "sourceRegion": "Question 3a",
              "description": "Right-angled triangle with vertical left side, horizontal base, right angle at lower left and theta at upper left. Ordinary outlines and labels use house black; source decorative angle shading is omitted.",
              "mathematics": "The side opposite theta is 5 cm and the hypotenuse is 10 cm.",
              "answerVisibility": "Only source givens and theta are visible."
            },
            "derived": false,
            "reviewStatus": "needs-review"
